<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
  <%= @invited_by&.name || "An admin" %> invited you to the Tally analytics dashboard.
</p>
<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
  <a href="<%= edit_invitation_url(token: @token) %>">Set your password and sign in</a> — the link works for 7 days.
</p>
<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
  If you weren't expecting this, you can ignore this email.
</p>
